  "story": {
    "zh": "一道山脉挡在镇子东边，深色的山岭谁也过不去。好在最北头有个山口能打隧道——浅色的山地只许铁路占用，别的人家碰都不能碰。",
    "en": "A mountain ridge blocks the east side of town, and nobody can cross its dark peaks. Luckily there is a pass at the far north where a tunnel can be dug — the light mountain cells may only be taken by railway track."
  },
